          {"id":"gr002txt","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p style=\"color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:right;\">Last Updated: <strong>[DATE]</strong></p>\n<p>In compliance with the <strong>Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020</strong>, Burans Valley has appointed a Grievance Officer to address all customer complaints and concerns.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#fdf9f5;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;margin:28px 0;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:0;\">Grievance Officer Details</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;width:40%;color:#555;\"><strong>Name</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;\"><strong>[GRIEVANCE OFFICER FULL NAME]</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;color:#555;\"><strong>Designation</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;\">[DESIGNATION — e.g. Founder / Customer Experience Head]</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;color:#555;\"><strong>Email</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;\"><a href=\"mailto:[GRIEVANCE EMAIL]\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">[GRIEVANCE EMAIL]</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;color:#555;\"><strong>Phone / WhatsApp</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;\">[PHONE] (Mon–Sat, 10am–6pm IST)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;color:#555;\"><strong>Address</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;\">[FULL REGISTERED ADDRESS, UTTARAKHAND]</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h2>How to File a Grievance</h2>\n<ol><li>Email the Grievance Officer at <strong>[GRIEVANCE EMAIL]</strong> with subject: <em>\"Customer Grievance — [Order ID]\"</em>.</li><li>Include: your name, registered contact, Order ID, description of the issue, and supporting photos/documents.</li><li>We will <strong>acknowledge your complaint within 48 hours</strong>.</li><li>We aim to <strong>resolve all complaints within 30 days</strong>. Complex cases may take longer — you will be kept informed.</li></ol>\n<h2>Escalation</h2>\n<p>If unresolved after 30 days, you may escalate to the <strong>National Consumer Disputes Redressal Commission (NCDRC)</strong> or the relevant State Consumer Forum under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019. You may also use the <strong>Government of India Consumer Helpline</strong>: <a href=\"https://consumerhelpline.gov.in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">consumerhelpline.gov.in</a> or call 1800-11-4000.</p>\n<h2>Related Policies</h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/return-refund-policy\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">Return &amp; Refund Policy</a> — order complaints</li><li><a href=\"/privacy-policy\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">Privacy Policy</a> — data complaints</li><li><a href=\"/terms-conditions\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> — contractual matters</li></ul>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.8,"sizes":[]}}}
        ]
      }]
